      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Christopher%20Calio\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Christopher Calio</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Christopher T. Calio is President and Chief Executive Officer of RTX. He was appointed CEO in May 2024 and has been President since March 2023. Previously, he served as Chief Operating Officer and President of Pratt & Whitney.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Pankaj%20Srivastava\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Pankaj Srivastava</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Pankaj Srivastava is the Chief Financial Officer of RTX, appointed in April 2024. He previously served as Senior Vice President, Finance and Corporate Strategy.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Shane%20Eddy\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Shane Eddy</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Pratt & Whitney</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Shane G. Eddy is President of Pratt & Whitney. He joined Pratt & Whitney in 2016 and has held various leadership roles in operations and supply chain.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Phil%20Jasper\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Phil Jasper</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Raytheon</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Phil Jasper is President of Raytheon. He previously served as President of Mission Systems at Collins Aerospace.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Stephen%20Timm\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Stephen Timm</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Collins Aerospace</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Stephen J. Timm is President of Collins Aerospace. He has been with the company and its predecessors for over 20 years.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Raja%20Maharajh\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Raja Maharajh</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Legal Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Raja Maharajh is Chief Legal Officer and Corporate Secretary of RTX.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Akhil%20Johri\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Akhil Johri</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Special Advisor to the Chairman and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President and CFO of United Technologies Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bernard%20Harris%2C%20Jr.\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bernard Harris, Jr.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2002</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chief Executive Officer and Managing Partner of Vesalius Ventures, Inc. and former NASA astronaut.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dinesh%20Paliwal\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dinesh Paliwal</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Partner at KKR & Co. Inc. and former Chairman and CEO of HARMAN International.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Oliver\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Oliver</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Member of the Board of Directors</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman and CEO of Johnson Controls International plc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gregory%20Hayes\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gregory Hayes</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">CEO & Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Gregory J. Hayes is the Executive Chairman of the Board of RTX. He served as CEO from 2020 to 2024 and previously as Chairman and CEO of United Technologies Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/James%20Winnefeld%2C%20Jr.\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">James Winnefeld, Jr.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired U.S. Navy Admiral and former Vice Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jamie%20Gorelick\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jamie Gorelick</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2000</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Partner at Wilmer Cutler Pickering Hale and Dorr LLP and former Deputy Attorney General of the United States.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jesus%20Malave\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jesus Malave</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2012</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Head of Investor Relations</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Malave has served as Chief Financial Officer since February 2022. He previously served as Senior Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of L3Harris Technologies, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20Harris%20II\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John Harris II</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2013</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Executive Officer, Raytheon International Inc. (Subsidiary)</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Vice President of Business Development for Raytheon Company and CEO of Raytheon International.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Leanne%20Caret\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Leanne Caret</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Member of the Board of Directors</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President of The Boeing Company and President and CEO of Boeing Defense, Space & Security.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Margaret%20O'Sullivan\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Margaret O'Sullivan</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Jeane Kirkpatrick Professor of the Practice of International Affairs at Harvard University's Kennedy School.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Ortberg\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Ortberg</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2018</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Special Advisor to the CEO</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former CEO of Rockwell Collins and former Special Advisor to the Office of the CEO of RTX.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Work\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Work</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">August 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former U.S. Deputy Secretary of Defense.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Stephen%20Page\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Stephen Page</a></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Executive Officer of Otis Elevator</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Page has served as a director since 2013. He previously served as Vice Chairman and Chief Financial Officer of United Technologies Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Thomas%20Kennedy\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Thomas Kennedy</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 31, 2014</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Chairman and CEO of Raytheon Technologies Corporation. Former Chairman and CEO of Raytheon Company.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Todd%20Probert\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Todd Probert</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2010</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Command and Control, Space, and Intelligence</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Probert has served as President of National Security and Innovative Solutions since 2020. He previously held executive roles at Raytheon.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tracy%20Atkinson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tracy Atkinson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President of State Street Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/William%20Swanson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">William Swanson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2004</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and CEO of Raytheon Company. Served as Raytheon CEO from 2004 to 2014.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gregory%20Hayes\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gregory Hayes</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Gregory J. Hayes is the Executive Chairman of the Board of RTX. He served as CEO from 2020 to 2024 and previously as Chairman and CEO of United Technologies Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Christopher%20Calio\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Christopher Calio</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and CEO of RTX.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tracy%20Atkinson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tracy Atkinson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President of State Street Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bernard%20Harris%2C%20Jr.\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bernard Harris, Jr.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chief Executive Officer and Managing Partner of Vesalius Ventures, Inc. and former NASA astronaut.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Oliver\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Oliver</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman and CEO of Johnson Controls International plc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Ortberg\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px d